# Review responsibility per module.
#
# Even Hand is one end-to-end system, built and delivered as a single pipeline:
# a course enters at eh-ingest and leaves as a report from eh-report, and
# `mvnw verify` builds and tests all of it. This file does not divide the project
# into two people's work. It records who reviews what first, so a change to a
# stage automatically reaches the person most familiar with it, and it satisfies
# the CS5013 project guide's section 10 request for named module ownership.
#
# Both of us review the other's code weekly from week one, because the viva
# examines each of us on the whole system rather than on a share of it.

